CraftUtopia Demo Process
=======================

This file describes the editable demo-log structure used by the frontend.

Core story
----------
The demo should be easy to understand:

    InitEnvironments
        - start minecraft server
        - init bot

    Transfer Image To Blueprint
        - show only three visible tool calls

    Build Blueprint
        - ProjectManager reads the blueprint
        - ProjectManager splits it into five Foreman sub blueprints
        - ProjectManager dispatches one sub blueprint to each Foreman

    Foreman-A Build Sub Blueprint
    Foreman-B Build Sub Blueprint
    Foreman-C Build Sub Blueprint
    Foreman-D Build Sub Blueprint
    Foreman-E Build Sub Blueprint
        - each Foreman owns one sub blueprint and 20 Workers
        - this is where most visible log events should live
        - Workers call tools, build, verify, repair, and submit subtasks
        - repeated tool patterns gradually become Skills

    Close And Clean Environment
        - final verification
        - cleanup
        - stop bots
        - close minecraft server

